You want to play catch? Here. Here.
Come here, come here. Here you go.

685
00:51:51,236 --> 00:51:52,445
Go get it.

686
00:51:53,279 --> 00:51:55,573
Okay, go get it.
Go get it.

687
00:51:56,616 --> 00:51:58,743
