That's what I wanted.

689
00:52:03,164 --> 00:52:05,959
Let's try another one.
Big one. Big long one.

690
00:52:06,835 --> 00:52:09,379
Okay, go get it. Go on.

691
00:52:09,462 --> 00:52:11,673
Good boy!

692
00:52:12,215 --> 00:52:14,092
Yeah! Now bring it back.

693
00:52:14,134 --> 00:52:16,344
Okay, come on.
Come on, boy, come on!

694
00:52:16,970 --> 00:52:19,931
What a good boy!
What a good boy!

695
00:52:19,973 --> 00:52:22,976
Aren't you the good boy!
Did you see that?

696
00:52:23,643 --> 00:52:25,645
I threw the ball,
he brought it back.

697
00:52:25,687 --> 00:52:28,356
First time, a fetch.
A real fetch. Yeah.

698
00:52:28,690 --> 00:52:30,608
Congratulations.
Thank you.

699
00:52:30,692 --> 00:52:33,069
You are a good boy!

700
00:52:33,153 --> 00:52:36,823
Okay, gotta go to work.
Come on, take your ball.

701
00:52:36,906 --> 00:52:39,659
There you go. First time.

702
00:52:40,452 --> 00:52:41,870
First time!

703
