No, no, you keep the ball.

709
00:52:56,009 --> 00:52:57,302
You want me to have that?

710
00:52:57,344 --> 00:52:58,887
I can't play now,
I gotta go to work.

711
00:52:58,970 --> 00:53:00,430
I gotta go to work.

712
00:53:01,014 --> 00:53:02,891
I'll keep the ball, all right?

713
00:53:02,932 --> 00:53:04,267
Okay. Here you go.

714
00:53:04,309 --> 00:53:05,810
Okay, thank you.
You're welcome.

715
00:53:05,894 --> 00:53:07,479
