I'll be here.

716
00:53:07,562 --> 00:53:10,357
Okay. Go home,
Hachi. Go home.

717
00:53:19,324 --> 00:53:23,703
All right, come here.
Come here. Come on. Okay.

718
00:53:23,787 --> 00:53:27,957
It's all right.
